    "description": "•\tPromoted to Software Engineer after 6 month internship and later Senior Software Engineer.\n•\tUtilized Python based backends (Django, Flask), PHP based backends (Laravel), Node based backends, and .NET based backends along with multiple database technologies to create RESTful backends and full sites for multiple products.\n•\tCreated highly available platforms that include real time communication, large data sets, and asynchronous task queues, all hosted on various cloud platforms like AWS and Azure.\n•\tUtilized various frameworks like Angular and React to create highly responsive progressive web applications. \n•\tWorked on multiple embedded projects spanning a range of microcontrollers and languages.\n•\tShifted between projects quickly to meet needs, with projects ranging from e-commerce and learning management systems, to real time alert management systems, interactive 3D experiences, and beyond.\n•\tWorked directly with managers and clients to help guide and meet goals.\n•\tWorked in both waterfall and agile environments with many different planning tools, such as Asana, Jira, Pivotal Tracker, and Trello. \n",
